{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Whatsapp corpus Berntzen"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"582539 (MetisID)"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:112986"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"W.P.M.S. Spooren"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/074554212"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Berntzen"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M.A. Hulsbosch"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/391248413"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E.R. Komen"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/079403980"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"H. van den Heuvel"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/136423701"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"RU  Radboud University"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Whatsapp conversations collected by master students Communication & Information Studies (2013-2014; 2014-2015). All participants in the conversations are over 18 and have signed consent forms. Metadata per conversation are available in CMDI XML files.<\/p><p>The corpus has been made available for the CLARIAH sponsored ACAD project.<br>See https:\/\/www.clariah.nl\/projecten\/research-pilots\/acad\/acad and https:\/\/cesar.science.ru.nl\/.<\/p><p>Cooperators:<br>Micha Hulsbosch - Radboud University Nijmegen, Faculty of Arts, Humanities Lab, TSG<br>Wilbert Spooren - Radboud University Nijmegen, Faculty of arts, Dutch language<br>Erwin R. Komen \t- Radboud University Nijmegen, Faculty of Arts, Humanities Lab, TSG<br>Patrick Sonsma \t- Radboud University Nijmegen, Faculty of arts, Dutch language<\/p><p>Whatsapp conversations collected by master students Communication & Information Studies (2013-2014; 2014-2015). All participants in the conversations are over 18 and have signed consent forms.<\/p><p>Original researcher:<br>Manon Berntzen - Radboud University Nijmegen, Faculty of arts, Dutch language<\/p><p>The corpus contains 60 WhatsApp chat sessions that have been collected by Manon Berntzen for the course on \"New media-new methods\" and then for her Bachelor thesis.<br>The exact date of each chat is included in the <event> tag attributes in the .folia.xml files.<br>The participants have all indicated that their chats can be used (in an anonymized form) for research purposes.<br>Metadata per chat are available in CMDI XML files.<\/p><p>The File textlist-folia.json contains an overview of all available texts in json format.<\/p><p>Note: the files are numbered 001-063 consecutively, but 058-060 (as well as 064) are excluded, because they lack permission.<\/p><p>===========================================================<br>Version: Date:        Notes:<br>1.0      10\/oct\/2018  [First] archiving of this corpus<br>===========================================================<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"social media"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"whatsapp"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"corpus linguistics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"syntactic analysis"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"prim